OL,3,ANew Mandelson papers reveal government
OL,4,Aconcerns over his shares in lobbying
OL,5,Afirm
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government has published more
OL,8,Fdocuments on the appointment of Lord
OL,9,FMandelson as US ambassador - we're
OL,10,Fgoing through them now
OL,12,FOne file shows an email exchange from
OL,13,FApril 2025 with an unnamed "US
OL,14,Fgovernment official", where Mandelson
OL,15,Frefers to a meeting that discussed
OL,16,F"alternative options" to the World
OL,17,FTrade Organization
OL,19,FThe official says it was a "delight" to
OL,20,Fmeet Mandelson, adding: "'Prince of
OL,21,FDarkness' couldn't be farther from the
OL,22,Ftruth!"
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
