OL,3,ANew Mandelson papers reveal government
OL,4,Aconcerns over his shares in lobbying
OL,5,Afirm
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe release includes documents that
OL,8,Fwere initially withheld at the request
OL,9,Fof the Metropolitan Police, but have
OL,10,Fnow been cleared for publication
OL,12,FThe Met is investigating allegations
OL,13,FLord Mandelson, while serving as a
OL,14,Fminister, passed on market-sensitive
OL,15,Finformation to the late convicted sex
OL,16,Foffender Jeffrey Epstein
OL,18,FLord Mandelson was sacked as ambassador
OL,19,Fin September 2025, and was arrested in
OL,20,FFebruary this year - read a timeline
OL,21,Fhere
